  "keyFeatures": [
    "Resolve any Hypixel nickname to the player's real username and UUID",
    "Fast in-memory LRU cache with 2-hour TTL for repeat lookups",
    "Rate-limited to 100 requests per minute per client",
    "Real-time cache invalidation via PostgreSQL LISTEN/NOTIFY",
    "Health check endpoint for uptime monitoring",
    "Standard JSON responses with clear error codes"
